{"id":"n16401-3-7","stage":2,"title":"가라앉다 · 平静","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n16401-3-7-1","ko":"여기 앉아서 놀란 마음이 가라앉을 때까지 좀 쉬고 있으렴.","zh":"坐在这里休息一会儿，等惊慌的情绪平复下来吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여기","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"앉아서","meaning":"坐","explanation":"앉다：坐；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"앉다","audio":"/audio/17e77d3fb6b2dbdb6258.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71463","senseId":"1","lemma":"앉다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"놀란","meaning":"惊吓，吃惊","explanation":"놀라다：惊吓，吃惊；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"놀라다","audio":"/audio/ca0d0655d175ea6cd75b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61607","senseId":"1","lemma":"놀라다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"마음이","meaning":"心情，心绪","explanation":"마음：心情，心绪；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"마음","audio":"/audio/aa9cbf25b5381e2c30cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20911","senseId":"3","lemma":"마음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가라앉을","meaning":"平静，平息","explanation":"가라앉다：平静，平息；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"가라앉다","audio":"/audio/345d89bb65a7be0b6a37.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16401","senseId":"3","lemma":"가라앉다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"때까지","meaning":"时，时候","explanation":"때：时，时候；까지：表示终点或范围：“到、直到、连……都”。","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74123","senseId":"1","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一会儿","explanation":"좀：一会儿","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"2","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"쉬고","meaning":"休息，歇","explanation":"쉬다：休息，歇；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"쉬다","audio":"/audio/62b3b824836a1f2cb1c5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71280","senseId":"1","lemma":"쉬다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있으렴.","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；으렴：向亲近的人或晚辈发出指示、劝告或请求。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"17e77d3fb6b2dbdb","term":"앉다","zh":"坐","audio":"/audio/17e77d3fb6b2dbdb6258.mp3","entryId":"71463","definition":"挺直上半身，将臀部置于别的物体或地上以支持身体的重量。","pronunciation":["안따"]},{"id":"ca0d0655d175ea6c","term":"놀라다","zh":"惊吓，吃惊","audio":"/audio/ca0d0655d175ea6cd75b.mp3","entryId":"61607","definition":"因遭到意外或害怕而在刹那间感到紧张或心跳加速。","pronunciation":["놀ː라다"]},{"id":"aa9cbf25b5381e2c","term":"마음","zh":"心情，心绪","audio":"/audio/aa9cbf25b5381e2c30cd.mp3","entryId":"20911","definition":"情绪或感受。","pronunciation":["마음"]},{"id":"345d89bb65a7be0b","term":"가라앉다","zh":"平静，平息","audio":"/audio/345d89bb65a7be0b6a37.mp3","entryId":"16401","definition":"强烈的感情或情绪慢慢消失。","pronunciation":["가라안따"]},{"id":"43bc9c47e0f938b1","term":"때","zh":"时，时候","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3","entryId":"74123","definition":"指某一瞬间或时间段。","pronunciation":["때"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一会儿","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"时间短暂地。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"62b3b824836a1f2c","term":"쉬다","zh":"休息，歇","audio":"/audio/62b3b824836a1f2cb1c5.mp3","entryId":"71280","definition":"为去除疲劳而使身体舒适。","pronunciation":["쉬ː다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/37cd5730830aee43288f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n16401-3-7-2","ko":"괜찮아요. 고맙습니다.","zh":"没关系，谢谢您。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"괜찮아요.","meaning":"没关系，无所谓，可以","explanation":"괜찮다：没关系，无所谓，可以；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"괜찮다","audio":"/audio/b9a2699f824000e36e45.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60097","senseId":"3","lemma":"괜찮다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"고맙습니다.","meaning":"感谢，感激","explanation":"고맙다：感谢，感激；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"고맙다","audio":"/audio/ded2b4943e89f57dd33d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20041","senseId":"1","lemma":"고맙다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"b9a2699f824000e3","term":"괜찮다","zh":"没关系，无所谓，可以","audio":"/audio/b9a2699f824000e36e45.mp3","entryId":"60097","definition":"不用担心或没有问题，可以允许。","pronunciation":["괜찬타"]},{"id":"ded2b4943e89f57d","term":"고맙다","zh":"感谢，感激","audio":"/audio/ded2b4943e89f57dd33d.mp3","entryId":"20041","definition":"因别人为自己做了什么，内心感到很满足，并想给予回报。","pronunciation":["고ː맙따"]}],"audio":"/audio/6c7cf6b9f64d3aadfa56.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.487,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=16401","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"3","sourceLevel":"중급","day":83,"sequenceScore":2.3137,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["没关系，谢谢您。","坐在这里休息一会儿，等惊慌的情绪平复下来吧。","你看起来好像因为东西太多而走不稳，要我帮你拿一点吗？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["坐在这里休息一会儿，等惊慌的情绪平复下来吧。","你看起来好像因为东西太多而走不稳，要我帮你拿一点吗？","没关系，谢谢您。"],"answer":2}]}
